            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti̱ti̱ kɛ kɛn nɛy tëë ci Muthɛ kɛ kuɛn kɛnɛ Ä-ron, tëë lua̱k kɛ ɛ bööth thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl da̱ŋ wäl rɛw. ",
