              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cu pekdiɛn diaal, a nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti kur bäkɛl wi̱cdɛ diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ kur dhieec wi̱cdɛ jiɛɛn dhieec.",
