            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɛ ni ji̱ Lii-bay kärɔ̱ /ca bi kuɛn tɔ̱ rɛy ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ɛ ni ɣöö bi ji̱ Lii-bay ka̱m la̱t kɛmɛkädä kɛnɛ kuakɛ diaal, bikɛ jɛ kap kɛ kuakɛ kɛɛl, kä bikɛ jɛ tit, kä bikɛ pua̱t gëëknikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi görkɛ wuɔ̱c kɛmɛkä, bi ji̱ Lii-bay ɛ ruɔ̱ɔ̱l kä mi görkɛ yiɛthdɛ piny, bi jɛ la̱t ni ji̱ Lii-bay mi wä radɔ̱diɛn ben thiekädɛ ba näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl akɛ pua̱tkɛ wi̱i̱kiɛn kɛ thuk duëlikiɛn, thok duëël ɔ kɛ wecdɛ, ram ɔ kɛ dhɔrɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi pua̱t ni ji̱ Lii-bay gëëkni kɛmɛkä palä, inɔ dɔ̱ɔ̱ ci gak Kuɔth dëë ben kä duɔl ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä bi ji̱ Lii-bay la̱tdiɛn a ti̱et kɛmɛkä palä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:54"
          },
          "items": [
